<title>AUSTRIA: Austria to stabilise deficit at below 3 pct-Klima.</title>
<headline>Austria to stabilise deficit at below 3 pct-Klima.</headline>
<dateline>SALZBURG, Austria 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian Chancellor Viktor Klima said on Thursday his government would do everything in its power to stabilise the country's budget deficit at below three percent of gross domestic product (GDP).</p>
<p>&quot;The Austrian government will do all which is necessary to stabilise our budget deficit below three percent,&quot; Klima told Reuters Financial Television in an interview.</p>
</text>
